or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 39 of the 75 years since 1951 on the middle of Republic County&rsquo;s 9 grids. On the middle of the grids, February to March ran 25% of normal in 2025 and 36% of normal in 2026. May to June is the wettest pair at 8.50 inches of normal. Grid 23531 had its driest year in 1956 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
